== Walkthrough ==

The bereft McMannus family needs revenge against a cyclops.

Begin by talking to any of the McMannus barbarians in the [[Western Plains of Karana]] Barbarian fishing village in the southwest corner, and asking them about their mother who seems to be missing.

You say, 'Hail, Brenzl McMannus'

: Brenzl McMannus says, 'Hail, traveler!  It is good to see new faces in our fishing village.  I am Brenzl McMannus.  I am quite talented with wood and string.  I sell the finest nets and bows in the land. Have a glance.'

You say, 'mother'

: Brenzl McMannus says, 'Unfortunately, she passed away a year ago. She was killed while defending our dogs from a giant. Do not ask our father, Einhorst, about our mother, Helsa. He does not need to be reminded.'

Talk to [[Einhorst McMannus]] in one of the huts: 

You say, 'Helsa'

: Einhorst McMannus says, 'My wife? She is dead. Crushed by the hands of a foul cyclops. I wish I could find that cyclops. I would pay greatly for his eye. I have slain every giant I could find, but I have not met him. I could still remember that cry of his...  BROOON!'

Head to the [[Eastern Plains of Karana]], and look for [[Broon]] who spawns in the east, at the base of the ramp going into the canyon. Kill [[Broon]], who drops [[Broon's Eye]].

Give [[Broon's Eye]] to [[Einhorst McMannus]]. 

: Einhorst McMannus says, 'Finally, my wife has been avenged. Thank you, my friend! Here. May this be used in many glorious battles!'

